s can focus on what matters: building great applications.",[228,229,231],"h2",{"id":230},"humane-representation-of-thought","Humane Representation of Thought",[224,233,234],{},"The rise of AI-assisted development has unlocked a new paradigm -- rapid iteration driven by natural-language intent and intelligent code generation. Kinotic is purpose-built for this paradigm. Whether a human developer or an AI agent is writing the code, Kinotic provides the guardrails, services, and runtime that turn quick prototypes into production-grade systems.",[228,236,238],{"id":237},"core-components","Core Components",[240,241,242,249,254,260],"ul",{},[243,244,245,248],"li",{},[246,247,5],"strong",{}," -- Applications that run on Kinotic OS. Today, Kinotic Apps are built with TypeScript running on Bun -- you write standard TypeScript for domain models, business logic, and UI, and the platform handles infrastructure, deployment, and scaling. Support for Go, Java, and Python backends is coming soon.",[243,250,251,253],{},[246,252,143],{}," -- The cloud operating system that runs your apps. It provides authentication, authorization, persistence, service mesh, observability, and deployment infrastructure out of the box.",[243,255,256,259],{},[246,257,258],{},"Kinotic OS Cloud"," -- A fully managed SaaS offering of Kinotic OS. No servers to provision, no infrastructure to maintain.",[243,261,262,265],{},[246,263,264],{},"Kinotic CLI"," -- The developer tool that ties it all together. Use it to initialize projects, define entities, generate service code, and deploy applications.",[228,267,269],{"id":268},"why-kinotic","Why Kinotic?",[271,272,273,289],"table",{},[274,275,276],"thead",{},[277,278,279,283,286],"tr",{},[280,281,282],"th",{},"Concern",[280,284,285],{},"Without Kinotic",[280,287,288],{},"With Kinotic",[290,291,292,304,319,330,341],"tbody",{},[277,293,294,298,301],{},[295,296,297],"td",{},"Authentication & Authorization",[295,299,300],{},"Wire up OIDC and session management yourself",[295,302,303],{},"Built in -- configure once, enforce everywhere",[277,305,306,308,311],{},[295,307,59],{},[295,309,310],{},"Choose a database, write migrations, build CRUD endpoints",[295,312,313,314,318],{},"Define entities, run ",[315,316,317],"code",{},"kinotic sync",", get a full service layer",[277,320,321,324,327],{},[295,322,323],{},"Service Mesh",[295,325,326],{},"Deploy sidecars, configure routing, handle retries",[295,328,329],{},"Automatic service discovery and RPC across the application",[277,331,332,335,338],{},[295,333,334],{},"CI\u002FCD",[295,336,337],{},"Maintain pipelines, container registries, rollout strategies",[295,339,340],{},"Handled by the platform",[277,342,343,345,348],{},[295,344,181],{},[295,346,347],{},"Instrument code, deploy collectors, build dashboards",[295,349,350],{},"SBOM generation, metrics, and tracing are included",[224,352,353,356],{},[246,354,355],{},"Rapid prototyping."," Go from an idea to a running application in minutes with the CLI and generated services.",[224,358,359,362],{},[246,360,361],{},"Enterprise-ready."," Software bill of materials and full observability mean you never have to rewrite for production.",[224,364,365,368],{},[246,366,367],{},"Internet scale."," The platform is designed to scale horizontally from day one.",[228,370,372],{"id":371},"what-these-docs-cover","What These Docs Cover",[224,374,375],{},"This documentation walks through everything you need to build and ship a Kinotic App:",[377,378,379,384,389,394,399,404],"ol",{},[243,380,381,383],{},[246,382,15],{}," -- Scaffold a project and persist your first entity in under five minutes.",[243,385,386,388],{},[246,387,19],{}," -- Understand how organizations, applications, projects, and artifacts fit together.",[243,390,391,393],{},[246,392,38],{}," -- Publish and consume services across your application.",[243,395,396,398],{},[246,397,59],{}," -- Define entities, configure indexes, and run queries.",[243,400,401,403],{},[246,402,92],{}," -- Set up authentication and authorization.",[243,405,406,408],{},[246,407,103],{}," -- Ship your application to Kinotic OS or Kinotic OS Cloud.",[224,410,411,412,415],{},"Ready to build something? Head to the ",[413,414,15],"a",{"href":16}," to create your first Kinotic App.",{"title":417,"searchDepth":418,"depth":418,"links":419},"",2,[420,421,422,423],{"id":230,"depth":418,"text":231},{"id":237,"depth":418,"text":238},{"id":268,"depth":418,"text":269},{"id":371,"depth":418,"text":372},"Learn what Kinotic is, why it exists, and how it helps developers and AI agents build enterprise-grade applications at scale.","md",null,{},true,{"title":11,"description":424},"kWAFExdJBuvap6cvr7VlVEwd-U_8NHeOdkZ707K3NTM",[426,432],{"title":15,"path":16,"stem":17,"description":433,"children":-1},"Get started building your first Kinotic App -- from a provisioned project to a running CRUD service in under five minutes.",1788943108538]